OL,3,GNEWSANew teacher returns to former
OL,4,Aschool for dream job
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs children begin returning to school,
OL,7,Fa newly-qualified teacher is set to
OL,8,Ftake a trip down memory lane after
OL,9,Fsecuring a job at her former school.
OL,11,FEvanie Morris used to attend Villiers
OL,12,FPrimary School in Bilston,
OL,13,FWolverhampton, and said she is
OL,14,F"excited" to be returning there at the
OL,15,Fstart of her career.
OL,17,FThe new teacher graduated from the
OL,18,FUniversity of Wolverhampton in July and
OL,19,Fwas overjoyed when she was able to
OL,20,Ffulfil her childhood dreams at her
OL,21,Fschool.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
